{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04749","headline":"奉和圣制春中兴庆宫酺宴应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制春中兴庆宫酺宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千龄逢啓圣，万域共来威。\n庆接郊禋後，酺承农事稀。\n御楼横广路，天乐下重闱。\n鸾凤调歌曲，虹霓动舞衣。\n合声云上聚，连步月中归。\n物覩恩无外，神和道入微。\n镐京陪乐饮，柏殿奉文飞。\n徒竭秋云影，何资春日晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}